bb_h263 Linux instructions
--------------------------
For Linux, the bb_h263 library is used as a self-contained, single .H file.
Run the install.sh shell script to copy it to /usr/local/include so that
it's visible to all of your projects.

./install.sh

After copying the bb_h263.h file, you can try running the example projects
in the examples folder. Each project has its own make file, so simply type
'make' to build them.

